B channeling implantation
B in <100>-Si, 100 keV, 7 Tilt, dose=1e13, #text#
 &setup    natom=2 nr=1 nion=10000 nionhis=8 /
 &ions     name='B' energy=100 dose=1e13 tilt=7 rotate=#rotate#
           moddiv=2 diverg=#diverg_x#,#diverg_y# /
 &material region=1 name='Si' xtal='yes'
           wafer=0.,0.,1. vsurf=1.,1.,0. /
 &geometry posif=0,1000000 /
 &output   lmom=t lhis=t wbox=200 nbox=0 /
